• Leadership Experience: 5+ years of experience managing and leading a team of partner managers at a top SaaS company, with a proven track record of achieving sales targets and driving revenue growth.

• Management &amp; Coaching: Excellent leadership and management skills with a "player-coach" mentality, willing to roll up your sleeves as an individual contributor when needed to motivate and inspire the team.

• Channel Operations &amp; Recruitment: Demonstrated experience in channel partner recruitment and onboarding, as well as working effectively with Sales Operations teams to maintain process-oriented execution.

• Field Collaboration: Proven track record as a cross-functional team player, serving as a trusted, "go-to" channel partner for field sales teams.

• Education: Bachelor's degree or equivalent practical experience.

Preferred Qualifications

• Cloud Ecosystem Expertise: Hands-on experience navigating and leveraging Cloud Service Provider (CSP) Marketplaces (e.g., AWS, Azure, GCP).

• Strategic Partner Matching: Proven ability as a "channel matchmaker," identifying and aligning the right partner capabilities to specific enterprise sales opportunities.

